     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Ok, The problem seems to stem from my low understanding of R.  Accessing the item of a list is different than say Python.  Here I was assigning a HTML object to jobs[1] when it should have been assigning to jobs[[1]], to access the value in the first index, not a slice of the first index.  Changing the assignment results in code that works as expected.</div>"
    ],
